  "recipeCuisine": "Japan",
  "name": "Grilled Mackerel with Chilli & Tamarind Sauce",
  "text": "Grilled Mackerel with Chilli & Tamarind Sauce\n\nYield: 4\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nIngredients\n\n2 cloves of garlic (peeled),\n\n1 tbsp of coriander (chopped, including the root),\n\n1 thin slice of fresh ginger,\n\n3 tsp fish sauce,\n\n1 1/2 tbsp oil,\n\n4 mackerel steaks.\n\nFor the Tamarind Sauce\n\n1 small fresh hot red chilli (deseeded and finely chopped),\n\n1 tbsp tamarind paste,\n\n2 tbsp palm sugar,\n\n1 tbsp fish sauce.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. In a spice grinder or blender, grind the garlic, coriander, ginger and fish sauce to a paste.\n\n2. Add the oil and blend again.\n\n3. Rub the mixture over the fish and set aside to marinate for 20 mins.\n\n4. In a small saucepan combine the tamarind sauce ingredients with 1/3 cup water and simmer for 3-4 minutes. Taste and adjust with extra tamarind, sugar of fish sauce. Remove from heat and set aside.\n\n5. Grill the fish for about 3 minutes on each side basting with the sauce.\n\n6. Serve, spooning over with the remaining sauce.",
  "recipeYield": "4",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "2 cloves of garlic (peeled),",
    "1 tbsp of coriander (chopped, including the root),",
    "1 thin slice of fresh ginger,",
    "3 tsp fish sauce,",
    "1 1/2 tbsp oil,",
    "4 mackerel steaks.",
    "For the Tamarind Sauce: 1 small fresh hot red chilli (deseeded and finely chopped),",
    "For the Tamarind Sauce: 1 tbsp tamarind paste,",
    "For the Tamarind Sauce: 2 tbsp palm sugar,",
    "For the Tamarind Sauce: 1 tbsp fish sauce."
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "In a spice grinder or blender, grind the garlic, coriander, ginger and fish sauce to a paste."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Add the oil and blend again."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Rub the mixture over the fish and set aside to marinate for 20 mins."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "In a small saucepan combine the tamarind sauce ingredients with 1/3 cup water and simmer for 3-4 minutes. Taste and adjust with extra tamarind, sugar of fish sauce. Remove from heat and set aside."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Grill the fish for about 3 minutes on each side basting with the sauce."
    },
